Apple currently plans to unveil its first smart glasses at WWDC 2027 next June, and privacy will be a focus, <a href="https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-07-26/apple-glasses-may-debut-at-wwdc-2027-privacy-camera-features-versus-meta-ms1v7lta">according to <em>Bloomberg</em>'s Mark Gurman</a>.<br/>
<br/>
